### Component 4: Work Task Engine (Employee)

#### DTOs & Services
- [NEW] `TaskDtos.cs` (`StartTaskRequest`, `TaskDto`, `ActiveTaskDto`, `TaskHistoryDto`)
- [NEW] `ITaskService.cs` / `TaskService.cs`:
  - `StartTaskAsync`: Auto-holds current running task if any, opens new task & `TaskTimeLog`, writes `ActivityTimeline`.
  - `HoldTaskAsync`: Changes status to `OnHold`, closes `TaskTimeLog`, writes `ActivityTimeline`.
  - `ResumeTaskAsync`: Changes status to `Running`, opens new `TaskTimeLog`, writes `ActivityTimeline`.
  - `CompleteTaskAsync`: Changes status to `Completed`, closes open `TaskTimeLog`, writes `ActivityTimeline`.
  - `GetActiveTaskAsync`: Returns currently running or held task for employee.
  - `GetTaskHistoryAsync`: Returns date-filtered task history.

#### API Controller
- [NEW] `TasksController.cs`:
  - `POST /api/tasks/start`
  - `POST /api/tasks/{id}/hold`
  - `POST /api/tasks/{id}/resume`
  - `POST /api/tasks/{id}/complete`
  - `GET /api/tasks/active/{employeeId}`
  - `GET /api/tasks/history/{employeeId}?from=&to=`

